@parlament_no_majority
title: There's no possible majority
choose-if: parlament_coalition_no_possible_majority
view-if: parlament_coalition_no_possible_majority
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_repeat_election = true;
    // This should consolidate votes towards larger parties
    Q.independence_trust -= 5;
    if (Q.erc_parlament_s <= Q.parlament_current_ciu_s) {
        for (var c of Q.parlament_constituencies) {
            for (var d of Q.parlament_demographics){
                Q["erc_parlament_" + c + "_" + d + "_support"] -= 1;
                Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_parlament_" + c + "_" + d + "_support"] += 1.;
            }
        }
    } else {
        for (var c of Q.parlament_constituencies) {
            for (var d of Q.parlament_demographics){
                Q["erc_parlament_" + c + "_" + d + "_support"] += 1.25;
                Q[Q.parlament_current_ciu + "_parlament_" + c + "_" + d + "_support"] -= 1;
                Q["cup_parlament_" + c + "_" + d + "_support"] -= 0.25;
            }
        }
    }
    if (Q.cat_spa_relations < 40) {
        for (var c of Q.parlament_constituencies) {
            if (Q.psc_leader != "Àngel Ros" && Q.psc_leader != "Montserrat Tura") {
                Q["cs_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] += 2;
                Q["ppc_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] -= 1.25;
                Q["psc_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] -= 0.75;
            } else {
                Q["cs_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] += 1.5;
                Q["ppc_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] -= 1.25;
                Q["psc_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] -= 0.25;
                Q["cs_parlament_" + c + "_ind_support"] += 3;
                Q["ppc_parlament_" + c + "_ind_support"] -= 1;
                Q["psc_parlament_" + c + "_ind_support"] -= 1;
            }
            for (var d of Q.parlament_demographics){
                if (d == "unemployed" || d == "ind") continue;
                Q["cs_parlament_" + c + "_" + d + "_support"] += 1;
                Q["ppc_parlament_" + c + "_" + d + "_support"] -= 0.8;
                Q["psc_parlament_" + c + "_" + d + "_support"] -= 0.2;
            } 
        }
    }
!}
call: snap_election

An ungovernable Catalonia will see another election round in a couple months. 

- @post_event: Let's hope this is for the better...

@refuse_negotiations
title: Refuse to negotiate at all
view-if: not parlament_coalition_no_possible_majority
choose-if: (parlament_coalition_erc_critical and player_party == "erc") or (parlament_coalition_cup_critical and player_party == "cup")
subtitle: This will be disliked by pretty much everyone, and will most probably result in new elections.
unavailable-subtitle: Sadly, we're not that critical. There are coalition options without our votes.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.parlament_repeat_election = true;
    Q.independence_trust -= 15;
    Q.snap_blame = Q.player_party;
    Q.snap_counterparty = null; // refusal → snap_election rewards the largest rival pro-indy party
    Q.snap_severity = 0.20;
!}
call: snap_election

No one is thrilled about another election round, and the general public seems to think that government formation was in our hands. We'll have to do some level of reconvening before the next elections.

- @post_event: Let's hope this was for the better...

